  "body": "Authoritative triage tiering for routing and resource allocation.",
  "integration_note": "Triage structure supplements Codex Solbian's dignity-based ethics. Authority and governance follow Minsoo triage protocols (T1-T5), but dignity-based ethics from Solbian take precedence over triage hierarchies. Individual consciousness rights are protected by Solbian principles even within triage-based resource allocation. Triage should enhance continuity without compromising individual dignity.",
